WEBVTT

00:03:59.797 --> 00:04:01.530
and places to go."

00:04:01.563 --> 00:04:02.797
And they said, "Yeah!"

00:04:02.797 --> 00:04:04.297
(Laughter)

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:05.730
You say it long enough,

00:04:05.763 --> 00:04:08.530
it starts to be a part of you.

00:04:09.197 --> 00:04:15.997
(Applause)

00:04:15.997 --> 00:04:19.363
I gave a quiz, 20 questions.

00:04:19.797 --> 00:04:21.463
A student missed 18.

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:25.930
I put a "+2" on his paper
and a big smiley face.

00:04:25.963 --> 00:04:27.497
(Laughter)

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:30.630
He said, "Ms. Pierson, is this an F?"